<title>USA: Inver Grove Heights, Minn., won by Smith Barney.</title>
<headline>Inver Grove Heights, Minn., won by Smith Barney.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smith Barney Inc said it won $4.325 million of Inver Grove Heights, Minn., general obligation tax increment bonds, Series 1997D, with a true interest cost of 5.514 percent.</p>
</text>
